    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal QSGNode responsible for rendering the plot grid into the scene graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes grid line positions from the same tick step as <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1AxisTickPainter" kindref="compound">AxisTickPainter</ref></computeroutput> so that grid lines stay aligned with axis tick marks under all zoom levels, including log scale. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
